  talentName: Celestial Blessing
  autoDescription: 1
  description: 'Raise your max Mana by 50 (up to 300; not while silenced) and your
    Mana Regeneration by 18% (Max 22%), then heal HP equal to 1.5x (Max 1.8x) your
    max Mana. It fires again every time you have 100 Mana: the bigger bar stores
    extra Mana and makes each heal bigger. Mana cost: 100.'
  manaCost: 100
  maxManaLimit: 300
  maxManaIncrease: 50
  manaRegenBonus: 18
  healPerMaxMana: 1.5
  needsFullBar: 0
